# apps/widget/.dockerignore
#
# Authoritative for the PRIMARY build context (apps/widget). The repo root arrives as the named
# context `workspace`, from which the Dockerfile copies an explicit list of manifests plus
# packages/ and apps/widget.

# ================================================================================================
# SECRETS
# ================================================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ================================================================================================
# BUILD OUTPUT AND DEPENDENCIES
# ================================================================================================
# A host dist/ copied in would ship a bundle built with a different __KB_API_ORIGIN__ — those are
# Vite `define` TEXT SUBSTITUTIONS baked at build time, so the loader would point at the wrong API
# origin on every customer page that embeds it, and every session mint would fail CORS.
# It would also bypass the two build-stage assertions (no surviving `__KB_` substring, and
# size-limit), which are the only things standing between a refactor and a blown brotli budget on
# code that runs on someone else's site.
dist/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ================================================================================================
# TESTS
# ================================================================================================
__tests__/
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
vitest.config.*
playwright.config.*
playwright/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
test-results/
coverage/

# ================================================================================================
# VCS, CI, EDITOR
# ================================================================================================
.git
.gitignore
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ================================================================================================
# DOCS
# ================================================================================================
README.md
docs/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   .size-limit.json  — the brotli budgets. `pnpm --filter widget size` runs INSIDE the build
#                       stage and its exit code is the stage's; without this file the command
#                       succeeds while measuring nothing.
